~ unlock

Forest Ranger: So...

Forest Ranger: You've finally proven yourself.

Forest Ranger: The Guide always has a good eye for people.

Forest Ranger: I'll open the bridge.

do GameDialogueManager.action_unlock_forest()
do SeedUnlockManager.unlock_seed("tomato_seeds")

Forest Ranger: Beyond this bridge lies the forest.

Forest Ranger: It will become an important part of rebuilding this farm.

Forest Ranger: The Seed Shop is now stocking Tomato Seeds.

do QuestManager.start_quest("tomato_harvest")

Forest Ranger: Try growing 5 Tomatoes and bring them to the Guide.

=> END


